{"pr": 38467, "type": "features", "branch": "9.0.x", "title": "Single file XLF catalog", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/38467", "issue": 37072, "issue_title": "POC - Refactoring XLF catalog", "issue_body": "Change the format of the XLF file as follow : \n```\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<xliff xmlns=\"urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2\" version=\"1.2\">\n  <trans-unit id=\"b2f40690858b404ed10e62bdf422c704\">\n    <source>Amount</source>\n    <target>Amount</target>\n  </trans-unit>\n  <trans-unit id=\"8c2857a9ad1d8f31659e35e904e20fa6\">\n    <source>Logo</source>\n    <target>Logo</target>\n  </trans-unit>\n  <trans-unit id=\"deb10517653c255364175796ace3553f\">\n    <source>Product</source>\n    <target>Product</target>\n  </trans-unit>\n  <trans-unit id=\"befcac0f9644a7abee43e69f49252ac4\">\n    <source>Tax excluded</source>\n    <target>Tax excluded</target>\n  </trans-unit>\n  <trans-unit id=\"f4a0d7cb0cd45214c8ca5912c970de13\">\n    <source>Tax included</source>\n    <target>Tax included</target>\n  </trans-unit>\n  <trans-unit id=\"689202409e48743b914713f96d93947c\">\n    <source>Value</source>\n    <target>Value</target>\n  </trans-unit>\n</xliff>\n```\nNext steps :\n\n1. Check that the proposal is a valid XLF format\n2. If valid, have the [translation tool](https://github.com/PrestaShopCorp/TranslationTool/) generate the file in the new format\n3. Update the default catalog of the Core\n4. /!\\ Manually revalidate translations (in all languages) in Crowndin", "base_commit": "507cba575e8a6f9418bbe4c4f1270bf65bf3b554", "merge_commit": "9edc0bf2e2fb66cfdef6d1687acff4c8ad71c2aa", "files": ["composer.lock", "src/Core/Translation/Export/TranslationCatalogueExporter.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Translation/Exporter/ThemeExporter.php", "tests/Unit/Core/Translation/Storage/Provider/Finder/DefaultCatalogueFinderTest.php", "tests/Unit/Core/Translation/Storage/Provider/Finder/FileTranslatedCatalogueFinderTest.php", "translations/