{"pr": 37638, "type": "features", "branch": "9.0.x", "title": "Switch carrier feature flag to stable and enabled by default", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/37638", "issue": 37785, "issue_title": "BO > new page Carriers > can't edit tax", "issue_body": "### Prerequisites\n\n- [x] I understand and accept the project's [code of conduct](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n- [x] I have already [searched in existing issues](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3ABug) and found no previous report of this bug.\n\n### Describe the bug and add attachments\n\nOn the new carriers page, it's not possible to edit a tax.\n\nhttps://www.loom.com/share/8e12d9cb3e2d40d998af2a3ad335a5aa\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nIt should be possible to make an edit of the tax\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. BO > Advanced Parameters > New & experimental features\n2. Carriers : Enabled\n3. BO > Shipping > Carriers\n4. Edit a carrier\n5. Go to Shipping locations and costs\n6. Change Tax and save\n7. See error\n\n### PrestaShop version(s) where the bug happened\n\n9.0.x\n\n### PHP version(s) where the bug happened\n\n8.1\n\n### If your bug is related to a module, specify its name and its version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Your company or customer's name goes here (if applicable).\n\n_No response_", "base_commit": "8b977856a4b4f854da117f08da068cf924a606a4", "merge_commit": "b1db7188a6ba70d6aa95f5d9bb671bead835d109", "files": ["admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/carrier/form/carrier-form-manager.ts", "install-dev/data/xml/feature_flag.xml", "src/Adapter/Carrier/CommandHandler/SetCarrierTaxRuleGroupHandler.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/DataHandler/CarrierFormDataHandler.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/DataProvider/CarrierFormDataProvider.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Improve/Shipping/Carrier/ShippingLocationsAndCostsType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/adapter/data_